            {
              "id": "letter",
              "kind": "letter",
              "title": "Letter received — customer correspondence",
              "meta": "Logged 21 Jan 2026 · Ref CC-2026-0114 · Received by post",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "p": "Dear Meridian,"
                },
                {
                  "p": "I understand from friends — customers like me — that you intend to take this service “digital first”. I learned this from a neighbour, not from you."
                },
                {
                  "p": "I have been a customer for nineteen years. You have my address — you write to me about everything else. Statements, renewals, changes to my terms."
                },
                {
                  "p": "Yet when you decided to ask customers what they thought, no letter came.",
                  "highlight": "Yet when you decided to ask customers what they thought, no letter came."
                },
                {
                  "p": "I am told there was a survey. Nobody I know received it."
                },
                {
                  "p": "If the decision is already made, say so. If it is not, I would like to be asked."
                },
                {
                  "signature": "Yours faithfully, Mrs J. Calder"
                }
              ],
              "annotations": [
                {
                  "id": "a-letter",
                  "after": 3,
                  "text": "This is where I started."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "slip",
              "kind": "slip",
              "title": "Reply slip",
              "meta": "Sent 04 Feb 2026 · Standard response",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "p": "Thank you for your feedback. Our consultation was statistically robust. No further action."
                }
              ],
              "annotations": [
                {
                  "id": "a-slip",
                  "after": 0,
                  "text": "Robust for whom?"
                }
              ]
